    "group": "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters",
    "summary": "As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you may pick 1 Mission Tactic not yet picked this battle. Until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts, it applies to every **DEATHWATCH** unit in your army:\n\n- **Furor Tactics**: those units' weapons have **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Malleus Tactics**: those units' weapons have **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Purgatus Tactics**: an attack by a **DEATHWATCH** model that scores a **[Critical Wound](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks)** has **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**.",
